Sure! Those coordinates point to the Googleplex in Mountain View, California.  
Below is a quick example of how you’d reverse‑geocode them with the Google Geocoding API, followed by the actual response you’d receive.

---

## 1. Reverse‑Geocode Request

```http
GET https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/geocode/json
    ?latlng=37.4224764,-122.0842499
    &key=YOUR_API_KEY
```

*Replace `YOUR_API_KEY` with your actual Google Maps API key.*

---

